]] active dry [[Cookbook:Yeast|yeast]]\n*4 tablespoons white granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n*1 cup yellow [[Cookbook:Cornmeal|cornmeal]]\n*½ cup white [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n*½ cup [[Cookbook:Whole Wheat|whole wheat]] flour\n*1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*Additional water, as necessary\n\n==Procedure==\n# Mix water, yeast, and sugar. Let this sit for a few minutes until it bubbles.\n# Stir in the rest of the ingredients, adding water until it is pourable.\n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] in a greased 9×9-inch pan at 350°F (175°C, gas mark 4) for 25 minutes or until the edges turn golden brown.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for cornbread]]\n[[Category:Southern U.S. recipes]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Vegan recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cornmeal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using yeast]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using whole-wheat flour]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Yeasted Cornbread","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 cup warm water","sourceText":"1 cup warm water","amountText":"1 cup warm water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tablespoon active dry yeast","sourceText":"1 tablespoon active dry yeast","amountText":"1 tablespoon active dry yeast","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"4 tablespoons white granulated sugar","sourceText":"4 tablespoons white granulated sugar","amountText":"4 tablespoons white granulated sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 cup yellow cornmeal","sourceText":"1 cup yellow cornmeal","amountText":"1 cup yellow cornmeal","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"½ cup white flour","sourceText":"½ cup white flour","a